Error [E1206]: unknown field `payload:` in `package.jet`
 Why: `payload:` is not part of the Package vocabulary. Identity is bare `name:` and `version:` at the top level (D-CONF-NAME1) — there is no `identity:` or `payload:` wrapper.
 Fix: use `name:`, `version:`, `deps:`, `outputs:`, `settings:`, `build:`, `policy:`, or `members:`; see docs/spec/syntax-decisions.md D-CONF-NAME1
